          }
        },
        "block_1_6mzkw6": {
          "type": "block_1",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Recycling Instructions",
            "content": "",
            "html": "<script src=\"https://app.bluebirdclimate.com/embed/summer-fridays?id=A52_QqNR_2XtSiBwAtEm_MJexVBr4TIrbVqLrRs1nwmHrnh_2nsFQWWtWph4SRPFyoFyWZUbeoq2VqHEOR_u1kY72mdyy5zH_Xu25dvSP5mQVRQOUUgwCA\" async=\"\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>"
          }
        },
        "block_1_6X4eXk": {
          "type": "block_1",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sustainability",
            "content": "<p>Learn more about sustainability <a href=\"/pages/sustainability\" title=\"Sustainability\">here</a>.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is CC Me Serum vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is CC Me Serum gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>CC Me Serum is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. </p><p>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.<br/></p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is CC Me Serum non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, CC Me Serum is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is CC Me Serum suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, CC Me Serum is suitable for all skin types. If you have any concerns, we recommend that you ‘patch test’ prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dnfwT7": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I wear CC Me Serum under makeup?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! When it comes to your skincare steps, we recommend using the serum after you have cleansed and toned and before you moisturize, apply SPF and put on makeup.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_CKzyHM": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When can I expect to see results?",
            "content": "<p>You’ll start to see a brighter complexion in just one week when applied daily! It takes a little longer to reduce the appearance of dark spots, but if you use CC Me Vitamin C Serum every day, you should start to see a more even complexion within 1-2 months.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_ACwxrA": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can CC Me Serum be used with all AHA’s?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! CC Me Vitamin C Serum is formulated to be used with all AHA’s, but we always recommend checking with a dermatologist if you have any concerns.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
      },
